flowchart TB
  User[User / business owner]
  UI[Local UI: Home, Assistant, Transactions, Documents, Tax readiness, Reports, Settings]
  Locale[Versioned local language packs + Intl formatting]
  Muse[Shared Meta Muse Spark runtime: schema-validated candidates]
  OCR[Existing local extraction / OCR: originals retained]
  Profile[Structured profile and independent jurisdiction / currency facts]
  Fabric[CountryPack Fabric: sanitized source evidence and candidate envelopes]
  Packs[Governed CountryPack / TreatyPack candidates]
  Resolve[Existing deterministic applicability / missing-fact resolvers]
  Tax[ONE Universal Tax Engine: separately scoped, governed calculation]
  Review[Human profile, rule, mapping and transaction review]
  Intake[Existing Universal Intake: Native / Chat / Document / External]
  FX[Existing explicit historical FX quote + human approval; original retained]
  Accounting[ONE Accounting Engine: exact Money, journals, audit, periods, idempotency]
  Reports[Deterministic recorded reports; stored historical FX replay]
  Explain[Grounded Muse fact selection + validated local rendering]
  User --> UI
  Locale --> UI
  UI -->|conversation| Muse
  UI -->|document| OCR
  OCR -->|untrusted extracted evidence| Muse
  Muse -->|candidate facts only| Profile
  Fabric --> Packs
  Profile --> Resolve
  Packs --> Resolve
  Resolve -->|requirements and explicit rule review| Review
  Review -->|scoped facts and governed approvals| Tax
  UI --> Intake
  Muse -->|transaction candidates only| Intake
  Intake --> Review
  Review -->|foreign transaction: dated quote review| FX
  FX -->|approved functional amount + original evidence| Intake
  Review -->|explicit transaction confirmation| Intake
  Intake -->|validated canonical command through existing boundary| Accounting
  Accounting --> Reports
  Tax -->|authoritative result when available| Explain
  Reports --> Explain
  Resolve -->|actual readiness and missing facts| Explain
  Explain --> UI
